  {
    "id": "async",
    "label": "Async, without the juggling",
    "title": "Loading, success, and errors. All observable.",
    "description": "Press Load projects to start a request. Try an error response, then turn it off and retry. The same observable future drives loading, errors, and the project list—without separate loading flags.",
    "file": "async.dart",
    "concept": "ObservableFuture + Observer",
    "link": "/gallery/async",
    "source": "../mobx_examples/lib/gallery/examples/async.dart",
    "region": "homepage",
    "translations": {
      "ko": {
        "label": "번거로움 없는 비동기",
        "title": "로딩, 성공, 오류. 모두 observable.",
        "description": "Load projects를 눌러 요청을 시작하세요. 오류 응답을 켜 본 뒤 다시 끄고 재시도해 보세요. observable future 하나가 로딩 플래그를 따로 두지 않고도 로딩, 오류, 프로젝트 목록을 모두 처리합니다."
      }
    },
    "code": "Widget projectsResult(ProjectsStore store) => Observer(\n  builder: (_) {\n    final request = store.request.value;\n    return switch (request?.status) {\n      null => const ProjectMessage('Your next projects are a click away.'),\n      FutureStatus.pending => const LoadingProjects(),\n      FutureStatus.rejected => const ProjectMessage(\n        'That didn’t go to plan.\\nTry again.',\n      ),\n      FutureStatus.fulfilled => ProjectList(request!.value!),\n    };\n  },\n);\n",
    "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Widget</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> projectsResult</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ProjectsStore</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> store) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Observer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  builder</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (_) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    final</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> store.request.value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> switch</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (request</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.status) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      null</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ProjectMessage</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Your next projects are a click away.'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      FutureStatus</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pending </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LoadingProjects</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      FutureStatus</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.rejected </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ProjectMessage</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'That didn’t go to plan.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Try again.'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      FutureStatus</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fulfilled </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span>